        },
        {
          "text": " 1)Register at JPJ Wilayah Perseketuan ,V Plate. Price is On The Road - Insurance 1st party all rider, road tax 1 year. Customer also can choose any state’s plate number. FREE of charge.",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "2)WHY buy from SHOPEE? We offer Credit Card MBB/PB/CIMB ZERO % interest instalment plan for 36 mths!! Buy Cash with FPX thru SHOPEE or Yesride Sdb Bhd (Public Bank A/C 3206-4557-23) Buy hire purcahse thru online loan application@ yesride.com.my/apply-loan-now/ OR send document to us 019-3167683 /012-2826992 ~documents required (IC, Slip Gaji x3, Bank Statement x1)",
