          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "4)Upon payment, we need owner IC back , front send to 019-3167683 /012-2826992",
          "type": 0,
          "ratio": null,
          "img_id": null,
          "description_type": 1,
          "empty_paragraph_count": null
        },
        {
          "text": "5)Once received product ~ pls give super five stars rating for Yesride. A mystery gift awaits.",
